# The forms of the relative marker that agree with a month name, which is a
# masculine singular noun (Grevisse and Goosse, Le Bon Usage: the names of the
# months are masculine). Only these close the year phrase of a part of a month
# as a lone trailing marker ("fin janvier dernier"); another form agrees with
# the word after it ("dernière minute", "pasada la fecha") and is left over.
# Invariant forms are kept.
dernier
passé
passe
prochain
suivant
ce
cet
